    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ClipForge Media Processing Pipeline\n\nAutomates video trimming, audio extraction (MP3), watermarking, and 9:16 vertical reframing using Apify (`budding_retrograde/clipforge`).\n\n### Prerequisites\n* An active **Apify API Token**.\n\n### Setup Instructions\n1. Send a `POST` request to the **Webhook Trigger** node URL.\n2. Include the following JSON payload in your request body:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"apifyToken\": \"YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN\",\n  \"videoUrl\": \"[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EXAMPLE](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EXAMPLE)\",\n  \"startTime\": \"00:00:10\",\n  \"endTime\": \"00:00:40\",\n  \"extractAudio\": true,\n  \"audioBitrate\": \"192k\",\n  \"verticalReframe\": false\n}",
        "height": 544,
        "width": 1136
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        112,
        176
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "24354e6b-b967-4a90-a6a1-fde8247c7391",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    }
  ],
